__3 As a separable preposition (with acc.) it means 
___(a) towards, in the direction of, to; तौ दम्पती स्वां प्रति राजधानीं प्रस्थापयामास वशी वसिष्ठः [[

]]; 
___(d) near, in the vicinity of, by, at, in, on; समासेदुस्ततो गङ्गां शृङ्गवेरपुरं प्रति [[Rām.]]; गङ्गां प्रति; 
___(e) at the time, about, during; आदित्यस्योदयं प्रति [[Mb.]]; फाल्गुनं बाथ चैत्रं वा मासौ प्रति [[

]]; 
___(f) on the side of, in favour of, to the lot of; यदत्र मां प्रति स्यात् [[Sk.]]; हरं प्रति हलाहलं (अभवत्) [[Vop.]]; 
___(g) in each, in or at every, [Page1067-2] severally (used in a distributive sense); वर्षं प्रति, प्रतिवर्षम्; यज्ञं प्रति [[

]]; 10. 29; 12. 51; 
___(i) according to, in conformity with; मां प्रति in my opinion; 
___(j) before, in the presence of; 
___(k) for, on account of. 
__4 As a separable preposition (with abl.) it means either 
___(a) a representative of, in place of, instead of; प्रद्युम्नः कृष्णात् प्रति [[Sk.]]; संग्रामे यो नारायणतः प्रति [[

